    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abusalomu kūngomela ise Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Abusalomu ūlagīja lyūbeejiwa igogoteni, jiigele na falasa ja kūlīduta, na banhū makūmi atanò ba kūyūja bakūpeelaga ū kū būtongi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī lūshikū ī dilū ū Abusalomu ūyūbiza ūlū wamisha waja kwīmīīla kw'ikūūwa lya kwingīla mu nzengo. Hūna ūlū munhū wiza alī na ng'hūmbū ja kūshika kūlī ntemi gīkī mihayo yakwe īkalamulwe, ū Abusalomu wamūja, “Ū bebe ūfumile nzengo gūlī?” Ū munhū ng'wenūyo washoshaga gīt'ūmo īlī;, “Ū ntūmami wako afumile kū sī ya lūganda lūlebe ū mu Isilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Abusalomu wanshokejaga, “Ī mihayo yako ū bebe ya ng'hana no, gwike dūhū a makoye ayo galīho galī gīkī, ū ntemi atī na ngunanhi wa kwīdegeleka ī mihayo yako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū Abusalomu ongejaga hangī na, “Nīyo gīt'ūlū ninasolwa nene ū kūbiza namuji ū mu sī īyī, būlī ng'wene ūyo alī na mhayo gwa kwibūūla ni wabiza na wiyaabī wa kūnenhela nene ī mihayo yakwe nīdegeleka, hama nīyo būlī munhū ni wayītīlwa mihayo ītūngīlīgije no.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama atagelelile henaho dūhū ū Abusalomu, alīyo būlī ng'wene ūyo wizaga ūlū ūng'wegeela hūna winama ū kū būtongi wakwe kūngīsha, ū Abusalomu wagoloolaga nkono wandima wambipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abusalomu wabīītīlaga gīko pye a Baisilaeli abo bizaga kūlī ntemi kūlwa kūgoloolelwa mihayo yabo; ūbiza wajiduta mu gīko pye gete ī ng'holò ja Baisilaeli, būngalūkīla we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta myaka īnè, ū Abusalomu ūng'wīla ū ntemi, “Nalīlomba ūnizunīlīje naje Hebuloni nakashikīlīje mhayo nebe nakanahīlīla SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū nene ntūmami wako aho nalī Geshuli ya Alamu, nakalahīla gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA ūlū ūnishosha hangī Yelusalemu, nakūja Hebuloni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hebuloni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ī lina lyenīlī lītīmo mu shandīkwa shimò na shimò.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nakanamye ū SEEBA.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūng'wīla, “Jaga mhola.” Ng'hana ūbūūka ūja ī Hebuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Abusalomu walī wamala kūtūma nhūng'wa mu mbisīla, jūja pye a hose ū mu ng'anda ja Isilaeli kūbawīla, “Ūlū ng'wigwa mhembe jalīla, ī likanza lyenīlo hamukagi mulīhaya gīkī, ‘Ū Abusalomu ntemi ī haha, alī Hebuloni.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ī Yelusalemu banhū magana abīlī baalī baanondeela ū Abusalomu. Baalī beegelejiwa ū kū shigukulu gītī bageni, baaja balī gīko dūhū batamanile yīngī yose yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abusalomu aho ataalī ūfunya shitambò ī Hebuloni, ūtūma banhū būja Gilo kū ng'wa Ahisofeeli būūkang'wenha kūfuma koi; ū ng'wenūyo hū walī ngunanhi ntaale o ng'wa Daūdi ū mu kahelele ka myanya. Ī likanza lyenīlo ū būgomi būbiza wapandīka nguzu; nīyo a balondeeji ba ng'wa Abusalomu būkwīla no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūpeela na kaya yakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla munhū waja ū kūlī Daūdi ūūkang'wīla, “Baba ntemi, ī ng'holò ja Baisilaeli ī haha jangalūkīlaga Abusalomu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho na haho ū Daūdi ūbawīla a batūmami bakwe abo baalī hamò nang'hwe ū mu Yelusalemu, “Tūpeelagi nguno ūlū ītī chene tūtūpūlūgūka ū kūlī Abusalomu. Nīyo shiigelile twīnge wangū, atizūtūkūūbīja akatūpandīkīla mu nzīla; nguno akūtūyagaja, nū nzengo agūkenaagūle na būūgī bo līlūshū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūmami bakwe ū ntemi būnshokeja būhaya, “A batūmami bako bamalīīlile kwīta mhayo gose gose ūyo alagūsole ū sīswe būgonzo ū ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū ntemi wandya lūgendo, nī kaya yakwe yūnkūūbīja pyī ī yose; alīyo ūbalekeela bakīma ikūmi abo baalī bake bakwe bado, kūlwa kūlīlang'hana ī likūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū ntemi ūja na a banhū a bose bakūnkūūbījaga, aho basegenela ho hado bīma kakanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū bakwe būyūbīta bajile, ū wei wīmīīlaga henaho; būbīta Bakeleeti, na Bapeleeti, na a Bagītī magana atandatū, a bose abo baalī banondeela kūfuma Gaasi, pyī būbīta ū kū būtongi wa ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūng'wīla ū Itai ū Ngītī, “Nū bebe ūlītūkūbīja a bise? Ni washoka ūkikale nū ntemi Abusalomu; nguno nīyo ū bebe ūlī ngeni ū ng'wenūmu, wapeelile kūfuma kū sī ya ng'wing'we haha īyī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wizile igolo goolo dūhū, hūna ī lelo nakwenheleje kūja ūkūyeela yeelaga hamò nise, alīyo natamanile nū kūko najile? Shokaga ūbashoshe a badūgū bako; ī shigongo sha ng'wa SEEBA nū būshikaanu wakwe shibize hamò nang'ho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Itai ūnshokeja ū ntemi alīhaya, “Nalīkwilahīlīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA mpanga, na gīt'ūmo būlī ū būpanga bo ng'wa baba būgonzo ū ntemi, hose hose ūko alaaje ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi, nūūlū ni mu būpanga nūūlū mu kūcha, nū nsese wako akūbiza ko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Itai, “Bītaga lūūlū ūje.” Ū Itai ū Ngītī ūbīta ajile na a banhū bakwe pye a bose, nī kaya ījo jalī hamò nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū baalīlaga ng'hūngū aho bajile; na lūūlū ū ntemi ūlūkīla ū longa lwenūlo hamò na banhū pye a bose, būshimīza bajile kū masaka ga kwitogolo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isandīko kūshoka Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sadoki walīko, nū Abiasali wiza hamò na a Balawī abo baalī balībūkije ī lisandīko lya būlagane bo ng'wa Mulungu; būshika būlītūūla hasī ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu kūshisha būbīta pye a banhū abo bafumaga ū mu nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūng'wīla ū Sadoki, “Līshoshage mu nzengo ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu. Ū SEEBA ūlū gūnyeja ū gwa kūnenha, akūnenha nize nalībone hangī nī lipandī lyakwe lya kwikala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ūhaya gīkī, ‘Ū bebe ūtūniyejaga ī haha;’ ū nene ng'wene nalīho namalīīlile, ni ītage gīt'ūmo atogelilwe we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū ntemi ūng'wīla ū Sadoki na, “Bebe ūtī ng'hangi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:27",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ng'hangi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makanza gamò akitanagwa moni.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Shokaga mu mhola ū kū nzengo, hamò nū ng'witūnja wako ū Ahimaazi, nū Yonasani ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Abiasali. Ū bebe nū Abiasali jagi ko na a bitūnja bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene ūlū nalashike a ha būkīlīlo wa mongo ū ng'wikūngū, nakūlindīīla kūshisha nigwe kūfuma kū bing'we ū mhayo ūyo mulīniwīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Sadoki nū Abiasaali būlīsola ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu būshoka nalyo Yelusalemu būūkikala kwenūko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wijomboki bo ng'wa Ahisofeeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ū ng'wene ongeja kūkolobela ajile akūlinhaga kū lūgūlū lwa mizeituni, kūnū akūlīlaga ūlū ajile. Waja wikundīkījaga ū kū ntwe, nū kū mhambala walī atī na shilatū shose shose. Na a banhū abo baalī hamò nang'hwe baja bikundīkījaga ū kū mitwe, kūnū bakūlīlaga nzīla ngima aho balīlinha ū mu lūgūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūwīlwa, “Nū Ahisofeeli alī ū kwipandī lya banhū abo baagomaga hamò na Abusalomu.” A henaho ū Daūdi ūlomba alīhaya, “Ee SEEBA, būgalūchage ū witegeleja bo ng'wa Ahisofeeli ū mu kahelele ka mihayo būbize būchilū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho washika ū kwigūlya ya lūgūlū ūko banhū baalī bamanīīlile kūjūnamya Mulungu, būnsanga Hushai muna Aliki, walī wabīma nzīla, na shizwalo shakwe shitandagūkile, nū kū ntwe wisaamagūlīlaga lūbuubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wīla, “Ū bebe ūlū ūlaje hamò nise ūkūbiza nigo ū kūlī nene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ūshoka ū mu nzengo ūkūng'wīla ū Abusalomu, “Nakūbiza ntūmami wako baba ntemi, ī kwandya ng'hana naalī ntūmami o ng'wa so, alīyo ī haha nagalūkaga, nabizaga ntūmami wako, ūlū wīta gīko ūkūnigunanha mu nzīla ya kūnkenaagūja ū Ahisofeeli ī mihayo īyo akwīhelaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bagabīji ū Sadoki nū Abiasaali bakūbiza koi; na lūūlū ūkūyūbawīla būlī mhayo ūyo ūkūgwigwa ū ng'wikūlū lya ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bitūnja babo balīko koi; ū Ahimaazi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Sadoki, nū Yonasani ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Abiasali; a benabo h'abo mukūyūbatūma ū kūnenhela yose yose īyo ūkūyigwaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū nwani ng'wiye o ng'wa Daūdi ū Hushai ūshoka ū kū nzengo, aho alīshika koi nū Abusalomu hū ūshika ū mu Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
